Short:        Default programs per file type
Uploader:     (We fill this in at upload time)
Author:       Dalsin Limited
Type:         util/wb
Version:      0.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.2.0
Distribution: Aminet

OpenTypes is a preferences editor that says which program opens each kind of
file, and applies it to the icons, so default programs are as easy to set as
on a modern desktop.

- Every type, from the datatypes and the default icons, with the program that
  opens it now and the programs that can.
- Choose a program per type: the type's default icon gets it, so files without
  icons open with it.
- The icons files already have that still name the old program are listed and
  updated on Apply, backed up first, with Undo. An icon set to a different
  program on purpose is left alone unless you tick it.
- Open with... in Workbench's Tools menu, with Always use this.
- Types by file name too, for files no datatype recognises.

GadTools, icon.library only, no patches.

Status: designed; in development.

